0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD/Intel CPU running at 3.5 GHz or higher. AMD FX 6300 X6 or newer is recommended.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia/AMD dedicated graphcs card, with at least 2GB of dedicated VRAM.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Studio Tolima"],"publishers":["DON'T NOD"],"release_date":"1 Apr, 2025","metacritic_score":80}